      "writtenOn": "2026-09-09T01:24:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`minimum: 1` is added to prevent NVMeSensor::sample() from underflowing scanDelay when ErrorRetryDelay is set to 0, which would delay the retry by UINT_MAX seconds.\n`multipleOf: 1` explicitly aligns the value with NVMeSensor\u0027s 1-second polling interval. It also ensures the configured value matches what\u0027s actually used at runtime, since the value is truncated when cast to an unsigned int",
